# Implementation Plan - HOTFIX-012 — Limit Maximum Overlay Transparency to 99%

Limit the maximum overlay transparency to 99% so BatmanOverlay is never completely invisible (0.01 minimum opacity).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The transparency range is now strictly constrained to 0% – 99%. Any legacy settings containing 100% transparency will be automatically normalized to 99% on application startup without validation crashes.

